  <rdf:Description rdf:nodeID="commodity_somer_cb0">
    <crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>this (12 gros somers) is surely in error, since the tunnage and poundage account (p. 364) records 12 gros pins) | saddle for a pack-horse (OED s.v. somer 1) (see also sella, hakeney sadelle)</crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>
